## Runic Permissions 1.0.0
## Copy to BepInEx/config/chazman.RunicPermissions.cfg only if you want to
## preconfigure the value before the first launch.
## Group management needs no configuration and no F5 console. In Valheim chat,
## type /group help. Active Group choices are stored server-side per world/player.

[Security]

## Enables the audited administrative bypass path. An administrator must still
## deliberately enter admin mode and provide a session ID and justification for
## every request. Explicit server/object denies and uncertain security data are
## never bypassed. Restart the game/server after changing this setting.
# Setting type: Boolean
# Default value: false
AdminBypassEnabled = false
